{"id":"n15652-1-9","stage":2,"title":"뽑히다 · 被拔出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15652-1-9-1","ko":"어머, 너 무슨 일이야? 머리가 왜 그래?","zh":"哎呀，发生什么了？头发怎么这样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦。","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}},{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"일이야?","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이야","audio":"/audio/07685cceee2c1aebca4e.mp3"}},{"text":"머리가","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리가","audio":"/audio/9318933bae4caa2e24ff.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그래?","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/76e5c053b4b5d88355df.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15652-1-9-2","ko":"여동생이랑 싸웠어. 머리카락이 얼마나 뽑혔는지 모르겠다.","zh":"和妹妹打架了，都不知道被扯掉了多少头发。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여동생이랑","meaning":"妹妹","explanation":"여동생：妹妹；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"여동생","audio":"/audio/3670c9dce0fb583071d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71002","senseId":"1","lemma":"여동생","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여동생이랑","audio":"/audio/6ec10afe42bd0bb1e3b8.mp3"}},{"text":"싸웠어.","meaning":"打架，争斗","explanation":"싸우다：打架，争斗；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"싸우다","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29732","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싸웠어","audio":"/audio/8ec0fb42136654065996.mp3"}},{"text":"머리카락이","meaning":"发丝","explanation":"머리카락：发丝；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"머리카락","audio":"/audio/7cffa7bdc9cb4857c797.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55381","senseId":"1","lemma":"머리카락","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리카락이","audio":"/audio/cacfbe3db1a94bf2a5c4.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少。","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}},{"text":"뽑혔는지","meaning":"被拔出，被拔掉","explanation":"뽑히다：被拔出，被拔掉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；는지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"뽑히다","audio":"/audio/e38b8bcd2bc666678047.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15652","senseId":"1","lemma":"뽑히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뽑혔는지","audio":"/audio/6eaceb2cb6146dfd54e7.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠다.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠다","audio":"/audio/0d0d884c5b6e7dff10b6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3670c9dce0fb5830","term":"여동생","zh":"妹妹","audio":"/audio/3670c9dce0fb583071d8.mp3","entryId":"71002","definition":"比自己小的女子。","pronunciation":["여동생"]},{"id":"e27f0e273d4af17d","term":"싸우다","zh":"打架，争斗","audio":"/audio/e27f0e273d4af17d7ed1.mp3","ent